# API memory-bank moat

`3DAIGC-API/memory-bank/` is **entirely gitignored** (same policy as OpenNexus). Ops notes (Krea, Kimodo, XR voice, sessionmem seeds, activeContext) stay on disk and sync via **scp only**.

## Never

- `git add memory-bank/` or any file under it
- Paste memory-bank ops detail (job IDs, token failure playbooks with secrets) into tracked `docs/`

## Do

- Edit local `memory-bank/*.md` as needed for agents
- Sync with DGX ↔ Surface scp scripts when ops notes must travel
